From: =?UTF-8?q?Ond=C5=99ej=20Jirman?= <megi@xff.cz>
Date: Sat, 20 Nov 2021 14:35:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 65/90] drm/rockchip: cdn-dp: Disable CDN DP on disconnect

Why not?

Signed-off-by: Ondrej Jirman <megi@xff.cz>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/cdn-dp-core.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/cdn-dp-core.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/cdn-dp-core.c
index 190cce9530c8..0c46224c0491 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/cdn-dp-core.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/cdn-dp-core.c
@@ -898,6 +898,7 @@ static void cdn_dp_pd_event_work(struct work_struct *work)
 		DRM_DEV_INFO(dp->dev, "Not connected; disabling cdn\n");
 		dp->connected = false;
 
+		cdn_dp_disable(dp);
 	/* Connected but not enabled, enable the block */
 	} else if (!dp->active) {
 		DRM_DEV_INFO(dp->dev, "Connected, not enabled; enabling cdn\n");
